    <h2>About This</h2>

    <p>This project is a full-stack CRUD (Create–Read–Update–Delete) web app that manages tasks with a simple,
        responsive UI.</p>
    <p>The backend uses Node.js + Express for routing and middleware, EJS for server-side templating,
        and MongoDB (via Mongoose) for persistence.</p>
    <p>
        I have also added a list adding feature where user can add new list from which they can have seperate list items
        for different lists.
    </p>
